---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/layout/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <slot name="head">
    <title>Video to Image Converter Features - Frame Extraction Tools Online Free</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Discover powerful video to image converter features: manual frame capture, interval extraction, smart scene detection. Convert video to JPG, PNG, WebP, AVIF online free. 100% client-side, no uploads.">
    <meta property="og:title" content="Video to Image Converter Features - Frame Extraction Tools Online Free">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Discover powerful video to image converter features: manual frame capture, interval extraction, smart scene detection. Convert video to JPG, PNG, WebP, AVIF online free. 100% client-side, no uploads.">
    <meta property="og:image" content="/logo.svg">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://freevideotoimage.com/features">
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="Video to Image Converter Features - Frame Extraction Tools Online Free">
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="Discover powerful video to image converter features: manual frame capture, interval extraction, smart scene detection. Convert video to JPG, PNG, WebP, AVIF online free. 100% client-side, no uploads.">
  </slot>
  <Header currentPath="/features" />
  <main class="flex-1">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="page-hero-content">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="text-center">
            <p class="eyebrow mb-4">The complete toolkit</p>
            <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-5xl tracking-normal">Features</h1>
            <p class="body-lg max-w-[600px] mx-auto text-center">
              Powerful extraction modes, multiple output formats, and smart scene detection — all running in your browser.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Mesh Gradient Background -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-0 pointer-events-none">
        <svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="gradient" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
              <stop offset="0%" stop-color="{colors.cyan}" />
              <stop offset="25%" stop-color="{colors.violet}" />
              <stop offset="50%" stop-color="{colors.pink}" />
              <stop offset="75%" stop-color="{colors.magenta}" />
              <stop offset="100%" stop-color="{colors.cyan}" />
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>
          <rect width="100" height="100" fill="url(#gradient)" opacity="0.08" />
        </svg>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SEO Content Section -->
    <section class="page-section bg-[var(--color-canvas-elevated)]">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <span class="mono-eyebrow mb-3">About Our Video to Image Converter</span>
          <h2 class="heading-lg mb-4 text-center">Professional Frame Extraction Tools for Every Need</h2>
          <p class="body-md max-w-[600px] mx-auto text-center">
            Our comprehensive suite of video to image converter tools empowers creators, designers, and professionals to extract frames from any video with precision and ease. All processing happens client-side for maximum privacy.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="editorial-copy">
          <p>Looking for a reliable <strong>video to JPG converter</strong> or <strong>video to PNG converter</strong>? Our platform combines multiple extraction methods into one intuitive interface, making it the ultimate <strong>video to image converter online</strong> solution. Whether you need to <strong>convert video to image</strong> for social media, create a <strong>video screenshot</strong> collection, or generate a <strong>video to image sequence</strong> for editing, we have the tools you need.</p>
          <p>Unlike other services that require uploading your videos to external servers, our <strong>video to image converter online free</strong> operates entirely within your browser. This means your files never leave your device, ensuring complete privacy and security. You can freely use our <strong>video frame extractor</strong> without worrying about data exposure or file size limitations (up to 2GB).</p>
          <p>Our advanced <strong>video to image ai</strong> powered scene detection intelligently identifies key moments in your videos, reducing redundancy while preserving important visual content. For precise control, our manual frame-by-frame capture lets you extract the exact frame you need, perfect for creating thumbnails or memes.</p>
          <p>When it comes to output options, we support all major formats: PNG for lossless quality, JPG with adjustable compression (70-95%), WebP for modern web optimization, and AVIF for superior compression. Download your extracted frames individually or as a convenient ZIP archive using our efficient <strong>video to image download</strong> system.</p>
          <p>Experience why professionals choose our tool as their go-to <strong>video to photo converter</strong> for extracting still images from videos. Whether you're creating content, analyzing footage, or preserving memories, our client-side approach ensures your creative workflow remains private, efficient, and unrestricted.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Features Grid -->
    <section class="page-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <span class="mono-eyebrow mb-3">What You Can Do</span>
          <h2 class="heading-lg mb-4 text-center">Everything you need to extract frames</h2>
          <p class="body-md max-w-[500px] mx-auto text-center">
            Our video frame extractor provides professional-grade tools for every use case.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <!-- Manual Frame Capture -->
          <article class="feature-card hover:shadow-[0px_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] transition-shadow">
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <h3 class="heading-md mb-2">Manual Frame Capture</h3>
              <p class="body-md">
                Scrub through your video frame-by-frame and capture exact moments with pixel-perfect precision.
                Perfect for catching that split-second action or subtle expression.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- Interval Extraction -->
          <article class="feature-card hover:shadow-[0px_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] transition-shadow">
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <h3 class="heading-md mb-2">Interval Extraction</h3>
              <p class="body-md">
                Automatically extract frames at set intervals — every second, every 5 seconds, or custom timing.
                Ideal for creating timelapses or documenting processes over time.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- Smart Scene Detection -->
          <article class="feature-card hover:shadow-[0px_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] transition-shadow">
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <h3 class="heading-md mb-2">Smart Scene Detection</h3>
              <p class="body-md">
                AI-powered scene boundary detection extracts only the key frames when content changes.
                Reduces redundancy by focusing on meaningful visual transitions.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- Multiple Output Formats -->
          <article class="feature-card hover:shadow-[0px_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] transition-shadow">
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <h3 class="heading-md mb-2">Multiple Output Formats</h3>
              <p class="body-md">
                Export to PNG (lossless), JPG (70-95% quality), WebP (70-95% quality), or AVIF (50-80% quality).
                Choose the right balance of quality and file size for your needs.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- ZIP Download -->
          <article class="feature-card hover:shadow-[0px_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] transition-shadow">
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <h3 class="heading-md mb-2">ZIP Download</h3>
              <p class="body-md">
                Download all frames as a convenient ZIP archive with streaming for large extractions.
                No more clicking through hundreds of individual downloads.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- 100% Client-Side -->
          <article class="feature-card hover:shadow-[0px_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] transition-shadow">
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <h3 class="heading-md mb-2">100% Client-Side</h3>
              <p class="body-md">
                Your videos never leave your device. All processing happens locally in your browser.
                Complete privacy and security — no uploads, no servers, no data collection.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Technical Details -->
    <section class="page-section bg-[var(--color-canvas-elevated)]">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <span class="mono-eyebrow mb-3">Technical Excellence</span>
          <h2 class="heading-lg mb-4 text-center">Built for Performance</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <h3 class="heading-md mb-3">High Performance</h3>
            <p class="body-md">
              Optimized JavaScript and WebAssembly ensure smooth performance even with large video files.
              Frame extraction happens in real-time with minimal latency.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <h3 class="heading-md mb-3">Format Support</h3>
            <p class="body-md">
              Supports all major video formats: MP4, WebM, MOV, AVI, MKV, and more.
              Any video playable in your browser can be processed.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <h3 class="heading-md mb-3">Privacy First</h3>
            <p class="body-md">
              Zero data leaves your browser. We don't use analytics, tracking, or cookies.
              Your creative work stays completely private and under your control.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <h3 class="heading-md mb-3">No Limits</h3>
            <p class="body-md">
              Process videos up to 2GB in size. Extract hundreds of frames without restrictions.
              No watermarks, no registration, no hidden limitations.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>